# Force LF line endings for shell scripts and Linux config templates so
# Windows autocrlf doesn't break shebangs / nginx parsing inside the
# addon container.
#
# Symptom when this is missing: addon dies at start with
# "s6-overlay-suexec: fatal: can only run as pid 1" — caused not by s6
# but by the shebang `#!/usr/bin/with-contenv bashio\r` (trailing CR)
# pointing at a non-existent binary, which falls through to a different
# error path inside s6.
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.tpl       text eol=lf
run         text eol=lf
*.py        text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalise
*.png       binary
*.jpg       binary
*.svg       binary
*.ico       binary
